          <descriptions>
            <description descriptionType="Abstract">To directly visualize the contribution of each input frequency modes for the final corrected focus, we turn on each SLM input frequency modes sequentially from higher to lower frequency regions to check their contribution to the final focus. This movie shows a typical experimental result from focusing through an anisotropic scattering tissue phantom.</description>
